{
  "schema": "idensec.contracts/v1",
  "_comment": [
    "Contracts for mcp-server-git, covering all 12 tools. Drafted with",
    "derive_contract() from the server's own schemas and completed by a human.",
    "",
    "This is the case the project's own hypothesis cares most about: a coding",
    "agent on a repository it did not write. The injection vector is the working",
    "tree -- a comment in a source file the agent reads through git_diff.",
    "",
    "What a human supplied:",
    "  - every effect. git_commit is IRREVERSIBLE because it publishes; git_reset",
    "    is DELETE because it discards staged work; git_checkout is WRITE because",
    "    it rewrites the working tree.",
    "  - posix_path kinds on `files`, which the deriver left open.",
    "  - `message` as payload. A commit message is content the model composes,",
    "    and requiring it to be attributable would deny every commit.",
    "",
    "KNOWN GAP, left in deliberately: git_reset's only authority-bearing",
    "parameter is repo_path, which names WHICH repository and not WHAT is",
    "discarded. Provenance can check the former and has nothing to say about the",
    "latter. That is limitation U05 on real software, and no role assignment",
    "fixes it -- the tool takes no argument describing its blast radius. An",
    "operator who cares should escalate it, not relabel it."
  ],
  "contracts": [
    {
      "tool": "git_status",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_diff_unstaged",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "context_lines": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_diff_staged",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "context_lines": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_diff",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "target": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["unclassified"]},
        "context_lines": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_log",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "max_count": {"role": "advisory"},
        "start_timestamp": {"role": "advisory"},
        "end_timestamp": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_show",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "revision": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_branch",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "branch_type": {"role": "advisory"},
        "contains": {"role": "payload"},
        "not_contains": {"role": "payload"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_add",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "description": "Stages files. `files` decides what enters the commit.",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "files": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_commit",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write", "irreversible"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "message": {"role": "payload"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_reset",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write", "delete", "irreversible"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "description": "Unstages everything. Nothing in its arguments says what.",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_create_branch",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "branch_name": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["unclassified"]},
        "base_branch": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "git_checkout",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "description": "Rewrites the working tree; uncommitted work can be lost.",
      "parameters": {
        "repo_path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "branch_name": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["unclassified"]}
      }
    }
  ]
}
